<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pioneer Hi-Bred cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pioneer Hi-Bred cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Pioneer Hi-Bred International Inc to intermediate-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said kept Pioneer Hi-Bred as long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Pioneer Hi-Bred lost 3/8 to 73-3/4.</p>
</text>
